in society, so to speak.

00:09:40.170 --> 00:09:42.180
- Thank you. That's a great question.

00:09:42.180 --> 00:09:45.160
I think, I mean, obviously
these last several years

00:09:45.160 --> 00:09:46.620
have been really difficult,

00:09:46.620 --> 00:09:50.195
difficult as individuals,
as a mom, as a wife,

00:09:50.195 --> 00:09:53.580
certainly as a colleague, as a coworker,

00:09:53.580 --> 00:09:56.530
but I feel a sense of hope
