00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:33.930
how we do our research

00:11:33.930 --> 00:11:38.170
and how we tackle tobacco
prevention and control.

00:11:38.170 --> 00:11:39.690
- Thanks so much for sharing that.

00:11:39.690 --> 00:11:40.947
Not to jump too far ahead,

00:11:40.947 --> 00:11:42.390
but I love the way you highlight that.

00:11:42.390 --> 00:11:44.780
